OL,3,GNEWSAMan's plea to launch blind
OL,4,Abaseball team
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who plays blind baseball for Team
OL,7,FGB is urging visually impaired people
OL,8,Fto help him establish a team in the
OL,9,FEast Midlands.
OL,11,FSteve Smith, from Ilkeston in
OL,12,FDerbyshire, has retinitis pigmentosa, a
OL,13,Frare hereditary condition that left him
OL,14,Fblind and unable to drive or continue
OL,15,Fworking as a mechanical engineer.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
