OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMan's plea to launch blind
OL,4,Abaseball team
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 47-year-old, who took up visually
OL,7,Fimpaired sports while waiting for
OL,8,Fadditional support, said he wants to
OL,9,Fset up a blind baseball team in Long
OL,10,FEaton as the nearest clubs to him are
OL,11,Fin Hartlepool, Preston, Manchester,
OL,12,FSheffield and Liverpool.
OL,14,F"The nearest team around here is
OL,15,FSheffield, so we are looking to set a
OL,16,Fteam up in Long Eaton and create our
OL,17,Fown community," said Smith.
